### Profile & Storage Infrastructure (`src/browser/profile_manager.py`)

#### [NEW] [src/browser/profile_manager.py](file:///c:/github/batmanoverlay.com/src/browser/profile_manager.py)
- `BrowserProfileManager`: Manages workspace-specific browser profile directory trees:
  - Path structure: `data/browser/profiles/{profile_id}/` (`cache/`, `cookies/`, `history/`, `downloads/`, `sessions/`).
  - Provides profile resolution, isolation, creation, and path queries using `pathlib.Path`.

---

### Session Lifecycle Management (`src/browser/session_manager.py`)

#### [NEW] [src/browser/session_manager.py](file:///c:/github/batmanoverlay.com/src/browser/session_manager.py)
- `BrowserSessionManager`: Manages saving, loading, restoring, closing, and workspace switching for browser sessions using `JsonStore`.

---

### Browser Service (`src/browser/service.py`)

#### [NEW] [src/browser/service.py](file:///c:/github/batmanoverlay.com/src/browser/service.py)
- `BrowserService`: Implementation of `IBrowserService`:
  - URL Normalization: Converts raw inputs (`google.com`, `localhost:8000`, `192.168.1.1`) into normalized `http://` / `https://` URLs.
  - Search Query Detection: Identifies queries (e.g. `python pyside6 tutorial`) and constructs search engine URLs (default DuckDuckGo: `https://duckduckgo.com/?q=...`).
  - Navigation abstraction, session & profile lifecycle coordination, cookie/cache cleanup interfaces.

